+// `base.name(...)` whose callee is not otherwise known is taken for the one function that the program stores under that name, if
+// there is exactly one, behind a check that it is that function (GuardKind::IsKnownFunction): with no type table, that is all
+// that there is to go by. Needs no type table.
+class MethodsOfProgram {
+    WTF_MAKE_TZONE_ALLOCATED(MethodsOfProgram);
