+    // After collection. Any thread. The one function stored under the name, or zero if there is none or more than one, or if the
+    // name is one of the standard objects' methods (`indexOf`, `call`, `then`: a program's `indexOf` is seldom what is called by that
+    // name). `others` says whether anything else is stored under the name (the check then fails now and then).
+    uint32_t onlyMethodNamed(UniquedStringImpl* name, bool* others = nullptr) const
